\ls17\ilvl0\cb4 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
B and C separate the two halves cleanly. The cited-side fact (animal-only MeSH for B; 
\fs28 \cf9 \cb10 is_retracted=False
\fs30 \cf2 \cb4  + human MeSH for C) is metadata-grounded. The claim-side judgment \'97 does the claim over-reach (B) or is it supported (C) \'97 is model-inferred and flagged 
\fs28 \cf9 \cb10 inference_flag=True
\fs30 \cf2 \cb4  on every B/C row, with an 
\fs28 \cf9 \cb10 inference_note
